{"id":"f53fcbebd4dfec57","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SetUses.md","title":"SetUses","display":"SetUses","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SetUses","parameters":["x","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SetUses"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>x</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>x</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SetUses x a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists E\n  (exists F (exists R (exists f (exists r (and (@ SetSig E F R f r) (@ FUses E F R f r x a)))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7bc2915a65f677d3\" href=\"?note=7bc2915a65f677d3\" title=\"ZFC_FUses\">FUses</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b769d4b8d11e5120\" href=\"?note=b769d4b8d11e5120\" title=\"ZFC_SetSig\">SetSig</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ SetUses x a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FUses","status":"resolved","id":"7bc2915a65f677d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FUses|FUses]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SetSig","status":"resolved","id":"b769d4b8d11e5120","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FUses|FUses]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":826,"backlinks":[{"id":"d33ef16e80f53d46","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]；[[ZFC_FVar|FVar]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SetFm|SetFm]]；[[ZFC_SetSub|SetSub]]；[[ZFC_SetUses|SetUses]]"},{"id":"564ea1d986d0c068","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]；[[ZFC_FVar|FVar]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SetFm|SetFm]]；[[ZFC_SetUses|SetUses]]"},{"id":"955dd3c4a7cff86a","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FEq|FEq]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]；[[ZFC_FVar|FVar]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_SetFm|SetFm]]；[[ZFC_SetSub|SetSub]]；[[ZFC_SetUses|SetUses]]"},{"id":"ee0894114d416943","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]；[[ZFC_FVar|FVar]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[